THIRD-PARTY SOURCE DATA

This licence applies to the derived, harmonised tables released here. The
upstream source datasets (GoldD3R, DDInter 2.0, PubChem, UniProt, HPO,
DrugBank, KEGG, MIMIC-IV demo, LIDDI, Micromedex) remain subject to their own
terms; see the provenance table in README.md. Content from sources whose terms
do not permit redistribution is represented only as aggregate counts and is not
included in this repository.

